<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="eyebrow">星维网络</text>
    <text class="title">账号与微信支付</text>
    <text class="sub">连接 wydlgf.cn 网站账号，扫码确认登录；已关联账号还可查看客服确认的待付款订单并在小程序内发起微信支付。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">登录网站</text>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="scanLogin" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">扫码登录网站</button>
    <view class="divider"><text>或手动输入 8 位登录码</text></view>
    <input class="code" type="number" maxlength="8" value="{{pairCode}}" bindinput="onCodeInput" placeholder="00000000" />
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="confirmCode" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认登录码</button>
    <text class="status {{statusType}}">{{status}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">当前微信关联状态</text>
    <block wx:if="{{linked}}">
      <text class="profile-name">{{displayName || '星维用户'}}</text>
      <text class="profile-meta">网站用户 ID：{{userId}}</text>
      <text class="profile-meta">业务订单：{{orderCount}} 条</text>
    </block>
    <text class="profile-meta" wx:else>当前微信尚未关联网站账号。首次扫码登录成功后会自动创建或进入对应星维账号。</text>
    <button class="ghost" bindtap="refreshProfile" loading="{{profileBusy}}" disabled="{{profileBusy}}">刷新关联状态</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{linked}}">
    <view class="section-head-row">
      <text class="section-title section-title-inline">微信支付</text>
      <button class="mini-link" bindtap="refreshPayments" loading="{{paymentLoading}}" disabled="{{paymentLoading || paymentBusyNo != ''}}">刷新支付状态</button>
    </view>
    <text class="profile-meta">付款金额和服务名称只来自客服在网站后台确认的支付单，小程序不会让你手填金额。最终支付成功只以服务器核验结果为准。</text>
    <block wx:if="{{payments.length}}">
      <view class="payment-item" wx:for="{{payments}}" wx:key="paymentNo">
        <view class="payment-line">
          <text class="payment-subject">{{item.subject}}</text>
          <text class="payment-amount">¥{{item.amountText}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="payment-meta">业务号：{{item.businessNo}}</text>
        <text class="payment-meta">{{item.hint}}</text>
        <button wx:if="{{item.canPay}}" class="primary payment-button" data-payment-no="{{item.paymentNo}}" bindtap="payPayment" loading="{{paymentBusyNo == item.paymentNo}}" disabled="{{paymentBusyNo != ''}}">微信支付</button>
        <text wx:if="{{item.paid}}" class="paid-badge">已支付</text>
      </view>
    </block>
    <text class="profile-meta" wx:else>暂无可显示的微信支付单。客服确认最终报价后，这里会自动出现。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{linked}}">
    <text class="section-title">账号资料</text>
    <input class="input" maxlength="60" value="{{nickName}}" bindinput="onNickInput" placeholder="设置网站显示昵称" />
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="syncNickName" loading="{{profileBusy}}" disabled="{{profileBusy}}">同步昵称到网站</button>
    <button class="ghost" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="syncPhone" loading="{{phoneBusy}}" disabled="{{phoneBusy}}">授权手机号用于业务联系</button>
  </view>

  <text class="foot">网站扫码登录仍需原浏览器二次确认。微信支付即使客户端显示完成，也必须由服务器收到微信验签通知或主动查单确认后才会标记为已支付。</text>
</view>
